Fork BACKBONE (backbone/php-activerecord). Zaznamy od 1.1.0 su po slovensky, starsie
su povodne z upstreamu (kla/php-activerecord). Vetvy: development (vyvoj), master
(iba cez PR z development, tagy), legacy-php7 (povodny master pred PHP 8).

Version 1.1.1 - 5. november 2026

Opravy:

- db6134b validates_uniqueness_of obaluje nazvy stlpcov aj primarneho kluca uvodzovkami
  rovnako ako hash podmienky v SQLBuilderi; stlpec s rezervovanym slovom (key, order)
  predtym na MySQL/MariaDB koncil SQL chybou 1064 uz pri ulozeni zaznamu (prevzate
  z upstream 99904dc, ktore bolo iba v legacy-php7); test s tabulkou valuestore

Version 1.1.0 - 5. november 2026

Prva verzia s podporou PHP 8.x (8.1 az 8.5), minimalna verzia PHP je 7.1. Obsahuje
vsetky upravy forku od 1.0 (vetva php82, predtym dev).

Zmeny oproti upstreamu (fork od 2013):

- 8bb4966 Model::find() (first, last, all) a find_by_*/find_all_by_* pri prazdnom
  vysledku vyhadzuju RecordNotFound (upstream vracia null / prazdne pole);
  find_or_create_by_* vynimku zachyti a zaznam vytvori
- 8bb4966, f693bcb lazy nacitane vztahy (belongs_to, has_one, has_many) pri chybajucom
  zazname vracaju null / prazdne pole namiesto vynimky
- 13c7a24 profilovanie dotazov - log obsahuje aj trvanie dotazu
- 4796087 vlastna trieda validacii cez Config::set_validator()
- e4c3f89 isset($model->x) skusa aj magicke gettery
- 75eb052 chybna trieda vo vztahu (Reflection) skonci citatelnou chybou
- c5acfad struktura suborov podla PSR-0 (lib/ActiveRecord), composer autoload
- 132b0d6 balik premenovany na backbone/php-activerecord

Opravy:

- 54c3939 datetime_to_string() bez casovej zony (Y-m-d H:i:s) - MariaDB/MySQL v strict
  sql_mode hodnotu s 'T' odmietali (chyba 1292)
- 3a21b5c nacitanie vztahov has_many s through
- 9985b94 PgsqlAdapter nepouziva pg_attrdef.adsrc (neexistuje od PostgreSQL 12)
- 6b534d5 find_by_pk() so skalarnou hodnotou (PHP 8: count() na skalar)
- 78eb892 atribut je dirty iba pri zmene hodnoty aj typu (!==)
- 00325f2, f5d94d5 atribut sa oznaci ako dirty iba vtedy, ked sa hodnota naozaj zmenila
- 401f4d3 DateTime - kompatibilita s PHP 7.1

Kompatibilita s PHP:

- cced8d0 PHP 8.5 (vlastnosti v retazcoch s {}, static:: callable, nedeklarovany $klass,
  fputcsv escape, strlen(null) v Utils/Expressions, is_hash)
- 9046a5d, 756eb65, a3243e3 PHP 8.0/7.4 deprecations (implode, spl_autoload_register,
  (double))
- 99f34ff, 65f4768, c43985c, d8a7d0c PHP 8.4 (explicitne nullable typy,
  AllowDynamicProperties, navratovy typ Errors::getIterator)
- a120b4a AllowDynamicProperties pre PHP 8.2+
- 268e441 az 6f96726 PHP 8.2
- 1d14161, d77aa36 PHP 8.1
- a15d12d, ed2a42f PHP 8.0 (povinny parameter za volitelnym, private final metody)
- 09cc57f PHP 7.4
- 57d434c minimalna verzia PHP >=7.1

Upstream zmeny medzi 1.0 a forkom (2010-2012, kla/php-activerecord), vyber:

- cache schemy tabuliek a modelov (Memcache, Memcached, APC), namespace pre cache
- SqliteAdapter, opravy PgsqlAdapter, ?charset= v connection stringu
- eager loading - respektuje volby vztahov, namespace v has_many through
- Model::query(), reestablish_connection(), attribute_is_dirty(), validate()
- update_all()/delete_all() s limit/order (MySQL, SQLite)
- serializacia to_csv a to_array, Errors::to_array()
- assign_attribute pre stlpce s inym inflected nazvom (velke pismena)

Version 1.0 - June 27, 2010

- d2bed65 fixed an error with eager loading when no records exist
- c225942 fixed set methods on DateTime objects to properly flag attributes as dirty
- 46a1219 fixed a memory leak when using validations
- c225942 fixed problem with some model functionality not working correctly after being deserialized 
- 3e26749 fixed validates_numericality_of to not ignore other options when only_integer is present and matches
- 53ad5ec fixed ambiguous id error when finding by pk with a join option
- 26e40f4 fixed conditions to accept DateTime values
- 41e52fe changed serialization to serialize datetime fields as strings instead of the actual DateTime objects
- dbee94b Model::transaction() now returns true if commit was successful otherwise false

Versio 1.0 RC1 - May 7, 2010

- support for Oracle
- support for PostgreSQL
- added delegators
- added setters
- added getters
- added HAVING as a finder option
- added ability to find using a hash
- added find_or_create_by
- added validates_uniqueness_of
- added dynamic count_by
- added eager loading
